  - `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` only React internals/radix; `innerHTML` only GTM/SendSafely (not user-controlled).
  - Informational secrets in JS (Google Maps key, TapPay `appKey`, reCAPTCHA site keys) — not in target vuln classes.
- Runtime test 1: visited `https://account.ui.com/login`, waited 7s, 31 requests; APIs `sso.ui.com/api/sso/v1/user/self` (401), `account-chooser` (200), `geo.svc.ui.com/geo`; no same-origin API.
- Runtime test 2: visited `https://account.ui.com/idp/login-result?code=BB_TEST_CODE&state=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fopencode-test`; `POST https://sso.ui.com/api/sso/v1/idp/login-result` → 400 `STATE_MISSING`; response sets `sso_idp_state=""` (state bound to cookie) → no open redirect; page text "Login session could not be verified".
- curl tests: `/login?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com` → 200 static SPA HTML (1634 bytes), no reflection; `/%3Cscript%3E...` same; CloudFront/S3 headers; CSP `script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' ... *.ui.com *.ubnt.com`, `frame-ancestors 'self' *.ui.com uic.uidev.tools *.uic.uidev.tools`.

### Active
- Route-by-route unauthenticated client-side testing; currently enumerating public route query-param flows.
- Next param flows to trace: `/security/suspicious/confirm` (`cUt` @6698371 reads `token` + `decision`, calls `QHt` inspect) and `/reset-password`, `/verify/verification-code/:uuid`, `/msp/idp/setup-result`, `/verify/success`.

### Blocked
- Test account creation blocked (reCAPTCHA Enterprise); all authenticated routes Unresolved.
- No confirmed vulnerability yet; client-side redirect/nav sinks appear allowlist-protected (`MC`/`Wpe`).
- Server-side testing effectively blocked by strict scope interpretation (APIs on sibling domains).
- No `result/testing-inventory.json`, `result/SUMMARY.md`, `result/unresolved.md`, `result/out-of-scope.txt`, or progress report written yet.

## Next Move
1. Inspect `QHt` / `cUt` and `/security/suspicious/confirm`, `/reset-password/password-reset-uuid/:uuid`, `/verify/verification-code/:uuid`, `/msp/idp/setup-result` in JS, then navigate to each public route with 5–10s waits and test param reflection/DOM XSS.
2. Write checkpoint files: `result/out-of-scope.txt` (list cross-origin API hosts incl. `sso.ui.com`, `sso.ubnt.com`, `*.svc.ui.com` and scope rationale), `result/inventory/routes.md` progress report (discovered/tested/pending), `result/testing-inventory.json`, `result/inventory/endpoints.md`, `result/inventory/sinks.md`, `result/inventory/listeners.md`, and update `result/logs/session.md`.

## Relevant Files
- `skills/AGENT.md`: master workflow/safety rules; follow exactly.
- `skills/client-side-skill.md`, `skills/server-side-skill.md`: required testing methodologies per route.
- `data/targets.txt`: authorization source (`account.ui.com` only).
- `result/scope.md`: prior scope notes (says same-origin JS/API in scope; console.byteplus.com out).
- `result/account-creation.md`: documents blocked registration + evidence paths.
- `result/client-side/account.ui.com/_app/javascript/index-D5t7M7xo.js`: main 7MB SPA bundle under analysis.
- `result/client-side/account.ui.com/_app/javascript/manifest.json`: actually saved HTML (not JSON metadata).
- `result/server-side/account.ui.com/traffic/register-probe.*`, `register-attempt1.*`, `register-attempt2.*`: registration evidence.
- `result/logs/target-state.txt`, `targets.sha256`, `session.md`, `agent-exit-code.txt`, `agent-watchdog.txt`: prior session/watchdog state.
- `result/inventory/routes.md`: existing route inventory (extend with progress).
- `opencode.json`: Chrome DevTools MCP config (port 9222).
- `tools/chrome-mcp-start.sh`, `tools/cmd.txt`: startup/tooling reference.
